When requested, follow `.cursor/skills/validate-integration-change/SKILL.md`.

Finish when `scripts/validate_integration_sail.py` exits 0 for that change.

Run Ocean only through `scripts/validate_integration_sail.py`. Never run `ocean sail` directly.

If that script fails with `missing Port credentials`, do not retry. Tell the user the changes are in place and validation did not run because Port credentials are not configured. Do not read `.env`.

If it fails for another reason, run it once more after fixing the registration, expectations, or integration change. If it fails again, or you are stuck, stop and report the script output.
